abstract: "Validation audit of tau2-bench v2.0.0 (airline, all 50 tasks; retail, all 114): do-nothing floors on tau2-bench and four external benchmarks, a 49-check defect audit with blind re-review and adversarial review, a stricter scoring protocol (v2), and a strong-vs-weak agent comparison under both protocols."
